{"id":"en_my-mischievous-blessings-in-disguise","title":"My Mischievous Blessings in Disguise","titleEn":"My Mischievous Blessings in Disguise","description":"Rachel Couls finds herself pregnant without warning, and Bernard Souls responds by taking her back to his home. As they spend time together, affection slowly develops between them. Their growing bond is threatened by Sadie Cheshire, a celebrity who wants Bernard for herself and sets out to hurt Rachel. Bernard stands by Rachel as she copes with the fallout from online gossip and difficulties within her family, while also confronting Sadie's plots. At the same time, the Souls family observes that Rachel bears a striking resemblance to the late wife of Jack Lane. In a twist, the Lane family mistakes Sadie for Jack's missing daughter because of their similar looks. With Bernard's help, Rachel works through the Lane family's internal disputes, recovers her true identity, and sees those who wro","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-mischievous-blessings-in-disguise/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-mischievous-blessings-in-disguise/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Billionaire","Sweet","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d43e0/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-mischievous-blessings-in-disguise_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d43e0/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-mischievous-blessings-in-disguise_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d43e0/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-mischievous-blessings-in-disguise_3","title":"Episode 3","season"